    {"id":"crown","x":-280,"y":-165,"width":255,"height":190,"type":"text","text":"👑 **THE SHATTERED CROWN**\n\nFive fragments wake ancient wards beneath the Black Peak. The Cult of Glass wants them assembled before the eclipse.\n\n**Next reveal:** Elira has one shard.","color":"#EDE9FE","vn":{"kind":"sticky","id":"crown","text":"👑 THE SHATTERED CROWN\n\nFive fragments wake ancient wards beneath the Black Peak. The Cult of Glass wants them assembled before the eclipse.\n\nNext reveal: Elira has one shard.","color":"#EDE9FE"}},
