    {"id":"rumours","x":-280,"y":60,"width":545,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"💬 **Rumours to spend:** the lighthouse flashes under clear skies · a dragon carries a bell tower · the mayor never casts a shadow · a dead god's dream leaks into the Thornwild.","color":"#F3E8FF","vn":{"kind":"sticky","id":"rumours","text":"💬 Rumours to spend: the lighthouse flashes under clear skies · a dragon carries a bell tower · the mayor never casts a shadow · a dead god's dream leaks into the Thornwild.","color":"#F3E8FF"}},
